  },
  {
    "description": "Update a series, changing only the provided fields (monitored, qualityProfileId, seasonFolder, tags, rootFolderPath, seriesType). When rootFolderPath is provided, the series path is automatically updated to <rootFolderPath>/<folderName>, and moveFiles is required: true moves the episode files with the record, false repoints the record only (the files stay put and Sonarr reports the episodes missing after a rescan). With moveFiles true, Sonarr queues the move as a background command and returns before the files move: the result carries moveCommandId to poll with sonarr_get_command (null when none was found).",
    "effect": "destructive",
    "input": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
